{"ID":"20251117165312-henmpbt","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251117165312-henmpbt","title":"UPL9-18——优化移动端渲染性能","type":"doc","updated":"20251121115607"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117165312-w7zqsne","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117165312-w7zqsne","updated":"20251117165621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免 alpha 测试"}]},{"ID":"20251117165603-ms6yxj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117165603-ms6yxj8","updated":"20251117165621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于一些低端移动设备，透明度测试是一项特别消耗资源的任务\n在大多数的情况下，我们应该尽量避免使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241120123139-t3fekhe","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"透明测试"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而是使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241121121110-xa0nvgw","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"透明混合"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来代替"}]},{"ID":"20251117165528-5xmspsb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117165528-5xmspsb","updated":"20251117165648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最小化 DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20251117165551-5ndjpom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117165551-5ndjpom","updated":"20251117165648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动设备上高 DrawCall 通常比填充率更容易造成性能瓶颈\n因此利用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250918203139-8ivqcls","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"批处理"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或者自己"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250922163105-fuf75zb","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"合并网格"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来降低 DrawCall 是移动平台上提高性能表现的有效手段\n我们应该尽量在移动平台上保证最小的 DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20251117165625-la98ut8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117165625-la98ut8","updated":"20251121115607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最小化材质数量"}]},{"ID":"20251117165716-zxmrn1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117165716-zxmrn1k","updated":"20251121115607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"材质数量和 DrawCall 数量息息相关，使用更少的材质，可以有效减少 DrawCall，还可以避免打断批处理\n并且它有有助于解决内存带宽问题，因此我们应该在移动平台上保证最小化材质数量"}]},{"ID":"20251117165724-e9l9iqv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117165724-e9l9iqv","updated":"20251117165808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最小化纹理大小"}]},{"ID":"20251117165730-o0t7um2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117165730-o0t7um2","updated":"20251117165807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和桌面 GPU 相比，大多数的移动设备的纹理缓存都非常小，对于一些老移动设备（iphone6s 以前），最大纹理大小仅支持 1024 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1024 大小\n目前市面上的大部分移动设备已经支持 2048 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2048，但是还是建议在项目初期，确定针对的最低配置目标机型\n了解该设备支持的最大纹理尺寸，从而来决定我们以什么尺寸来定规则，否则可能最终发布后在低端设备上会出现渲染问题"}]},{"ID":"20251117165808-0h6a1h4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117165808-0h6a1h4","updated":"20251117165910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"确保纹理是正方形且为2的幂"}]},{"ID":"20251117165821-ae0ww9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117165821-ae0ww9k","updated":"20251117165909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们应该尽可能的保证我们的纹理尺寸是正方形且是 2 的幂，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251117165832-94l0vbo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251117165832-94l0vbo","updated":"20251117165903"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117165847-8p2bs9d","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117165847-8p2bs9d","updated":"20251117165853"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117165847-1o5mkqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117165847-1o5mkqv","updated":"20251117165853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"32 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Childre